  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): チョウマメ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%81%E3%83%A7%E3%82%A6%E3%83%9E%E3%83%A1",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 108498830,
      "text": "チョウマメ は、マメ科クリトリア属（チョウマメ属）の多年生の蔓性（巻きつき性）草本である。一重のほかに八重咲き，白色，橙赤色などの園芸品種がある。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Clitoria ternatea",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clitoria_ternatea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1373036777,
      "text": "Clitoria ternatea, commonly known as Shankhupushpam , Asian pigeonwings, bluebellvine, blue pea, butterfly pea, cordofan pea, or Darwin pea, is a plant species belonging to the family Fabaceae and native to the Indonesian island of Ternate. In Indian Ayurveda it is commonly known by the name aparajita."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Clitoria ternatea",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clitoria_ternatea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 175428512,
      "text": "La conchita azul, clitoria, o campanilla, es una planta de la familia de las fabáceas."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Clitoria ternatea",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clitoria_ternatea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 234659497,
      "text": "Clitoria ternatea, le pois papillon bleu ou pois bleu, est une espèce de plantes à fleurs de la famille des Fabaceae. C'est une plante herbacée originaire d'Asie."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Clitoria ternatea",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clitoria_ternatea",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 72835201,
      "text": "Clitoria ternatea, comumente conhecida como ervilha-azul, ervilha-borboleta, feijão-borboleta e ervilha-cordofan é uma espécie vegetal pertencente à família Fabaceae. A origem em latim do gênero \"Clitoria\", de \"clitóris\", advém de uma associação das flores desta videira com os órgãos genitais femininos.. Produz uma infusão a partir de sua inflorescência, popularmente conhecida como chá azul."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Telang ternate",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telang_ternate",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29397941,
      "text": "Telang ternate adalah spesies tumbuhan endemik dan asli pulau Ternate yang termasuk dalam famili Fabaceae. Telang ternate adalah spesies terpopuler dari seluruh spesies dalam genus Clitoria."
    }
  },
  "sections": {
    "cultivation": {
      "en": {
        "source": "Wikipedia (en): Clitoria ternatea § Cultivation",
