        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
        "revision": 1373036777,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "C. ternatea does not suffer from any severe pest or disease problems.\n\n■ Pests\nRarely suffers from caterpillars, whiteflies, and spider mites.\n\n■ Diseases\nSuffers from anthracnose and bacterial soft rot. Rarely suffers from fungal root rots.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
  },
